## Quick Start

### 1. Install dependencies

```powershell
pip install -e .
```

Or directly:

```powershell
pip install numpy scipy pandas matplotlib statsmodels psutil click rich tabulate
```

### 2. Check host capabilities (read-only)

```powershell
python -m agrda check-capabilities
```

### 3. List available scenarios

```powershell
python -m agrda list-scenarios
```

### 4. View a randomized design

```powershell
python -m agrda design --scenario S1 --seed 42 --blocks 4
```

### 5. Run a simulation scenario

```powershell
python -m agrda simulate --scenario S1 --seed 42
python -m agrda simulate --scenario S0   # Null case
python -m agrda simulate --scenario S4   # Frequency pathway violation
python -m agrda simulate --scenario S6   # Carry-over detection
```

### 6. Run all tests

```powershell
python -m pytest tests/ -v
```

