## Project Structure

```
OS PROJECT/
├── agrda/                      # Main package
│   ├── capabilities/           # A. Read-only host capability detection
│   │   ├── detector.py         # CapabilityDetector (never changes system)
│   │   └── models.py           # OSType, CgroupVersion, RDTSupport, etc.
│   ├── workloads/              # B. Workload management
