│   │   ├── sim_backend.py      # Deterministic synthetic workload simulator
│   │   └── manager.py          # WorkloadManager (interface adapter)
│   ├── actuators/              # C. Actuator abstraction
│   │   ├── interface.py        # ActuatorInterface (abstract)
│   │   ├── sim_actuator.py     # SimActuator (in-memory, no system calls)
